  "title": "Apple Maps Renames Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' Amid US Trade Spat",
  "summary": "Apple Maps will show Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' for US users after President Donald Trump ordered the change, aligning with a shift in international policy. Meanwhile, MapQuest and the U.S. government are responding with different names, highlighting a broader naming policy debate.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Apple Maps will show Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' for US users after an executive order from President Donald Trump to change the name of the Great Lake.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "MapQuest and the U.S. government are responding with different names, highlighting a broader naming policy debate.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The renaming aims to align with national policy and reflect a shift in international policy.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
